# The repository stores LF, and working trees use LF on every platform.
# Letting Windows checkouts convert to CRLF made a tree copied from Windows to
# Linux show every file as modified. MSVC, Qt Creator and VS Code all read LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets (none are tracked yet; listed so the first one is not mangled).
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.icns binary
*.qm binary
*.pdf binary
